Package: APMD
Type: Package
Title: Analog Photography Metadata and 'EXIF' Editing via 'NOSSAFLEX'
Version: 0.1.9004
Authors@R: c(
  person("Alban", "Sagouis", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "sagouis@pm.me",
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3827-1063")))
Maintainer: Alban Sagouis <sagouis@pm.me>
Description: Photographs taken on film, developed, and scanned lack
    meaningful metadata, or carry only information from the scanning device
    rather than the original camera.
    Provides tools to parse file names following the NOSSAFLEX convention
    (Number, Shutter Speed, Aperture, Focal Length, EXposure) and to
    batch-rename scan files and write shot information into their
    Exchangeable Image File Format (EXIF) slots using 'exiftoolr'.
    Also accepts shot data in JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) format as
    exported by the 'analog' and 'Frames' apps, or in CSV format as exported
    by the 'Datafilm' app, allowing photographers to record metadata in the
    field and process it in 'R'.
